        {
          "text": "Angalieni, mmeachiwa nyumba yenu! Nami nawaambia, Hamtaniona tena kamwe, hata mtakaposema, Amebarikiwa ajaye kwa jina la Bwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
